# Cross-origin isolation is required by the threaded (atomics) engine wasm
# build: FRB's web worker pool shares the wasm memory with Web Workers via
# SharedArrayBuffer, which browsers only expose on isolated origins.
#
# `require-corp` (not `credentialless`) is used for cross-browser support
# (credentialless is Chromium-only). All cross-origin resources must be
# fetched with CORS or carry Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy headers; the app
# bundle itself is fully self-contained (no CDN canvaskit, no remote fonts).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-site
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-site
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
